{"title":"Imp Legs","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 7) · Monster drop: Small Copperhead</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 5 · INT/MAG 20 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 7 <span class=\"muted\">(399 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/imp-knick\">Imp Knick</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"small-copperhead\" title=\"Small Copperhead - Normal, 0.3% of recorded drops (1 / 358 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/79167631ab2fcb600a3d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Small Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.3%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"imp-legs\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-crude\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"imp-legs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"titan\">Titan</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"camel\">Camel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"weasel\">Weasel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"leopard\">Leopard</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"sage\">Sage</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"mage\">Mage</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Protection comes from the armor of all five pieces together, up to 75%.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>A full set of it protects</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/54076a59ff933aa8e55d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>0.4 armor · 0.8 magic defense</td><td>6% blows · 12% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/54076a59ff933aa8e55d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>0.4 armor · 1 magic defense</td><td>7% blows · 14% spells</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/imp-legs?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/54076a59ff933aa8e55d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\